(2849344, 398062, 24991, '<td valign="top">Great sthot, love the lighting and the model sure is a cutie.  Your color is off a few points, but that is to be expected with digital capturing skin tones.  The lines in the background are a bit distracting, but with basic edit, there''s not much you can do about it.  Overall, great shot.</td>', 'Great sthot, love the lighting and the model sure is a cutie.  Your color is off a few points, but that is to be expected with digital capturing skin tones.  The lines in the background are a bit distracting, but with basic edit, there''s not much you can do about it.  Overall, great shot.', '2006-09-20 01:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
