(2850461, 397885, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh there she is again.  What a subject with the backlit ringlets!  Such an exquisite image.  Would be worthy of a high end book, or expose'' on children''s photography. Despite the fact that she was put there for a photo, it looks natural and totally unpretentious. If I were to nitpick anything, I might crop so that the lattice in the back right corner is out of the shot.  Otherwise - perfect. Congratulations on another fine image! 9</td>', 'Oh there she is again.  What a subject with the backlit ringlets!  Such an exquisite image.  Would be worthy of a high end book, or expose'' on children''s photography. Despite the fact that she was put there for a photo, it looks natural and totally unpretentious. If I were to nitpick anything, I might crop so that the lattice in the back right corner is out of the shot.  Otherwise - perfect. Congratulations on another fine image! 9', '2006-09-20 10:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2850464, 398152, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  This would be cool in black and white too after doing some dodge and burn on the rocks.</td>', 'Nice composition.  This would be cool in black and white too after doing some dodge and burn on the rocks.', '2006-09-20 10:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
