(2851514, 398347, 50641, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  From your title, I make the fenced sheep the subject. I like that they are counterbalanced by grazing sheep on the diagonal.  I wonder whether it would matter if you flip this horizontally.  I''m really digging the depth of focus and the expanse of land that you captured here.  Good tonality too.  Interesting beyond the challenge... way to go :)</td>', 'Lovely.  From your title, I make the fenced sheep the subject. I like that they are counterbalanced by grazing sheep on the diagonal.  I wonder whether it would matter if you flip this horizontally.  I''m really digging the depth of focus and the expanse of land that you captured here.  Good tonality too.  Interesting beyond the challenge... way to go :)', '2006-09-20 15:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
