(2851744, 396485, 43774, '<td valign="top">Love the colours in the sky!</td>', 'Love the colours in the sky!', '2006-09-20 17:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2851759, 396508, 65918, '<td valign="top">I love this picture, I have one similar but in a rose garden. Maybe that''s why it reaches out to me!!! Nice!!!</td>', 'I love this picture, I have one similar but in a rose garden. Maybe that''s why it reaches out to me!!! Nice!!!', '2006-09-20 17:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2851846, 396499, 50695, '<td valign="top">omg, is that Karl Rove?? ;)</td>', 'omg, is that Karl Rove?? ;)', '2006-09-20 18:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2851984, 398616, 57886, '<td valign="top">Such a beautiful scenary.... Nice picture :o)</td>', 'Such a beautiful scenary.... Nice picture :o)', '2006-09-20 19:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2851987, 396754, 57886, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture... Nice closure to the challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful picture... Nice closure to the challenge.', '2006-09-20 19:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2851997, 396051, 63525, '<td valign="top">why so small!?</td>', 'why so small!?', '2006-09-20 19:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852002, 397586, 63525, '<td valign="top">beautiful! .. such a sense of softness</td>', 'beautiful! .. such a sense of softness', '2006-09-20 19:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852005, 396854, 3087, '<td valign="top">Intriguing image - reall like the inclusion of that somewhat surreal Clearance sign at the back left. Lovely toning too.</td>', 'Intriguing image - reall like the inclusion of that somewhat surreal Clearance sign at the back left. Lovely toning too.', '2006-09-20 19:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852007, 396294, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wow! Great colour and composition. The back of the leaf has an almost metallic texture. Nice!</td>', 'Wow! Great colour and composition. The back of the leaf has an almost metallic texture. Nice!', '2006-09-20 19:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852009, 396236, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautifully minimalistic yet full of potential interpretations.</td>', 'Beautifully minimalistic yet full of potential interpretations.', '2006-09-20 19:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852012, 397373, 36382, '<td valign="top">I like this, the best thing for me about the picture is the cool shadows.  Maybe you could have made more of them and also got rid of the yellow house in the background, which I find a bit distracting.  I like the colors of the bug and the flower, they compliment each other nicely.</td>', 'I like this, the best thing for me about the picture is the cool shadows.  Maybe you could have made more of them and also got rid of the yellow house in the background, which I find a bit distracting.  I like the colors of the bug and the flower, they compliment each other nicely.', '2006-09-20 19:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852014, 396485, 3087, '<td valign="top">The bird punctuates the shot just perfectly!</td>', 'The bird punctuates the shot just perfectly!', '2006-09-20 19:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852017, 397878, 36382, '<td valign="top">Seems a little bit out of focus.</td>', 'Seems a little bit out of focus.', '2006-09-20 19:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852039, 397683, 36382, '<td valign="top">It would have been great if you could have had all three people exactly in between the lines, but that probably wasn''t under your control.</td>', 'It would have been great if you could have had all three people exactly in between the lines, but that probably wasn''t under your control.', '2006-09-20 19:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852049, 398259, 36382, '<td valign="top">Nice lines and I like the figure.  I wish you could have somehow made her stand out more.</td>', 'Nice lines and I like the figure.  I wish you could have somehow made her stand out more.', '2006-09-20 19:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852050, 396696, 61705, '<td valign="top">Well spotted. The lines under the bridge take me from left to right, then the arrow leads me back again. Great job.</td>', 'Well spotted. The lines under the bridge take me from left to right, then the arrow leads me back again. Great job.', '2006-09-20 19:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852053, 398545, 36382, '<td valign="top">This is a cool looking place.</td>', 'This is a cool looking place.', '2006-09-20 19:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852055, 396726, 36382, '<td valign="top">I think I like this better with the horizon cropped out.  Nice silhouettes.</td>', 'I think I like this better with the horizon cropped out.  Nice silhouettes.', '2006-09-20 19:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852056, 397453, 61705, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene and shows a good understanding of leading lines.</td>', 'Beautiful scene and shows a good understanding of leading lines.', '2006-09-20 19:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852062, 398326, 64610, '<td valign="top">I think this is a unique picture - the blue is great. Original work!</td>', 'I think this is a unique picture - the blue is great. Original work!', '2006-09-20 19:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852065, 397373, 61705, '<td valign="top">Fantastic image! But I''m struggling to see the leading lines.</td>', 'Fantastic image! But I''m struggling to see the leading lines.', '2006-09-20 19:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852081, 398376, 36382, '<td valign="top">Lovely sky.  Lighthouse seems a tad bright.</td>', 'Lovely sky.  Lighthouse seems a tad bright.', '2006-09-20 19:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852122, 396480, 65924, '<td valign="top">Though not overly complicated, I like your image. It is simple, and simplicity is best sometimes, like here. The roadlines, and horizon lines work your eye to the cyclist quickly and uniformly. The composition adds a sense of urgency, while leaving it open, creating a sense of freedom in his urgency as well. Neutral, natural colors give this picture realism and life. I like it. Good job. Possibly cropping one third off of the left side a bit might have intensified this image by taking out some of the dead space.. and enhanced the image.</td>', 'Though not overly complicated, I like your image. It is simple, and simplicity is best sometimes, like here. The roadlines, and horizon lines work your eye to the cyclist quickly and uniformly. The composition adds a sense of urgency, while leaving it open, creating a sense of freedom in his urgency as well. Neutral, natural colors give this picture realism and life. I like it. Good job. Possibly cropping one third off of the left side a bit might have intensified this image by taking out some of the dead space.. and enhanced the image.', '2006-09-20 19:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852126, 398062, 65924, '<td valign="top">Absolutley Splendid. No comment needed beyond that. A winning image contender.</td>', 'Absolutley Splendid. No comment needed beyond that. A winning image contender.', '2006-09-20 20:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852131, 398223, 65924, '<td valign="top">Love the pattern and flow. It traps the eyes and draws interest progressively to the center where one wonders, "what''s down there" Where am I?<br/> <br/>EXCELLENT. Unfortunate about the blown out highlight at the top, but it is a negligable side effect... Cheers Mate. Hope you get top ranks for this one.</td>', 'Love the pattern and flow. It traps the eyes and draws interest progressively to the center where one wonders, "what''s down there" Where am I? EXCELLENT. Unfortunate about the blown out highlight at the top, but it is a negligable side effect... Cheers Mate. Hope you get top ranks for this one.', '2006-09-20 20:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852132, 397326, 61705, '<td valign="top">mmmmm... yes, do that....</td>', 'mmmmm... yes, do that....', '2006-09-20 20:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852134, 396995, 65924, '<td valign="top">Too Contrasy. Ruins exposure. Return EARLY morning and late in the day and try again. Shift camera right a pinch or try fliping camera sideways.</td>', 'Too Contrasy. Ruins exposure. Return EARLY morning and late in the day and try again. Shift camera right a pinch or try fliping camera sideways.', '2006-09-20 20:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852138, 395877, 34134, '<td valign="top">Nice capture! Like the composition.</td>', 'Nice capture! Like the composition.', '2006-09-20 20:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852151, 398409, 65924, '<td valign="top">A photo with a purpose. Designed for a specific use. This image OOZes leading lines. Interesting glamour and art image. SHows me the photographer is focused on his "clientelle". Excellent QUALITY. Could say or evoke more... I think the models eyes would have enhanced the image greatly with a little expression poping out from her dark mask.. poped eyes.. like exaggerated fear, anger, shock, surprise, loss. That woudl have been a nice touch had the model felt her pose better.<br/> <br/>Liek i said though Excelletn quality image.</td>', 'A photo with a purpose. Designed for a specific use. This image OOZes leading lines. Interesting glamour and art image. SHows me the photographer is focused on his "clientelle". Excellent QUALITY. Could say or evoke more... I think the models eyes would have enhanced the image greatly with a little expression poping out from her dark mask.. poped eyes.. like exaggerated fear, anger, shock, surprise, loss. That woudl have been a nice touch had the model felt her pose better. Liek i said though Excelletn quality image.', '2006-09-20 20:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852226, 398376, 62099, '<td valign="top">Awesome image!</td>', 'Awesome image!', '2006-09-20 20:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852228, 398238, 53779, '<td valign="top">I like this picture a lot.  It''s not the usual shot.  One thing that does bother me is the closest pillar on the right.  I find it takes away from the intended focus of the picture.  Aside from getting your feet wet, could you have moved a bit closer to remove the pillar from your field of view?</td>', 'I like this picture a lot.  It''s not the usual shot.  One thing that does bother me is the closest pillar on the right.  I find it takes away from the intended focus of the picture.  Aside from getting your feet wet, could you have moved a bit closer to remove the pillar from your field of view?', '2006-09-20 20:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852242, 396811, 53779, '<td valign="top">A nice take on a typical subject.</td>', 'A nice take on a typical subject.', '2006-09-20 20:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852265, 396499, 53779, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I see the leading lines.  The golf clubs only frame the subject to me.  Perhaps a different perspective would help.</td>', 'I''m not sure I see the leading lines.  The golf clubs only frame the subject to me.  Perhaps a different perspective would help.', '2006-09-20 20:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852273, 398374, 53779, '<td valign="top">Neat picture.</td>', 'Neat picture.', '2006-09-20 20:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852278, 396051, 53779, '<td valign="top">I think a different point of view would help make this an even better picture.  The path almost immediately leads the eyes out of the picture instead of further into the picture.</td>', 'I think a different point of view would help make this an even better picture.  The path almost immediately leads the eyes out of the picture instead of further into the picture.', '2006-09-20 21:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852280, 398185, 51553, '<td valign="top">If anyone cpmplains about this being too bright or blown out - tell them to go stuff their opinion up their telephoto lense.  I think the lighting makes the image.  (ps The models features don''t hurt it at all either.)</td>', 'If anyone cpmplains about this being too bright or blown out - tell them to go stuff their opinion up their telephoto lense.  I think the lighting makes the image.  (ps The models features don''t hurt it at all either.)', '2006-09-20 21:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852284, 398095, 51553, '<td valign="top">A pair of shoes in one of the lanes would make a neat statement.</td>', 'A pair of shoes in one of the lanes would make a neat statement.', '2006-09-20 21:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852286, 398018, 51553, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if it is intentional in your composition, but even the gable ends of the roof lead to the subject.  Very well done.</td>', 'I don''t know if it is intentional in your composition, but even the gable ends of the roof lead to the subject.  Very well done.', '2006-09-20 21:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852287, 398314, 51553, '<td valign="top">Very cool!</td>', 'Very cool!', '2006-09-20 21:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852291, 395760, 51553, '<td valign="top">neat lighting</td>', 'neat lighting', '2006-09-20 21:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852293, 398409, 51553, '<td valign="top">Neat idea.  I like the tone</td>', 'Neat idea.  I like the tone', '2006-09-20 21:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852296, 398501, 51553, '<td valign="top">I had the same idea...only problem is...rain, rain, and more rain.  I like it alot.</td>', 'I had the same idea...only problem is...rain, rain, and more rain.  I like it alot.', '2006-09-20 21:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852299, 398591, 51553, '<td valign="top">This has an over all appeal to me.</td>', 'This has an over all appeal to me.', '2006-09-20 21:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852300, 398353, 51553, '<td valign="top">DOF bang on!</td>', 'DOF bang on!', '2006-09-20 21:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852304, 397326, 51553, '<td valign="top">This would be a winner in my book with a little more dramatic lighting.  Still rate it high though.</td>', 'This would be a winner in my book with a little more dramatic lighting.  Still rate it high though.', '2006-09-20 21:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852305, 398429, 51553, '<td valign="top">This is cool.</td>', 'This is cool.', '2006-09-20 21:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852309, 398324, 51553, '<td valign="top">Very cool composition.</td>', 'Very cool composition.', '2006-09-20 21:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852310, 396310, 51553, '<td valign="top">Impressive.</td>', 'Impressive.', '2006-09-20 21:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852311, 396811, 51553, '<td valign="top">I like the cropping.</td>', 'I like the cropping.', '2006-09-20 21:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852315, 395858, 64462, '<td valign="top">nice idea</td>', 'nice idea', '2006-09-20 21:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852316, 396136, 51553, '<td valign="top">I could see this with a ribbon.</td>', 'I could see this with a ribbon.', '2006-09-20 21:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852323, 397885, 51553, '<td valign="top">Classic.</td>', 'Classic.', '2006-09-20 21:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852328, 398158, 53658, '<td valign="top">I love it! Original idea for lines!</td>', 'I love it! Original idea for lines!', '2006-09-20 21:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852332, 396937, 51553, '<td valign="top">There is a lot of conflict going on with the different directions of the railing and the cables.  I''m not sure how one would relieve it, or even if you would want to.  It keeps you looking at it!  I love the gradient sky.</td>', 'There is a lot of conflict going on with the different directions of the railing and the cables.  I''m not sure how one would relieve it, or even if you would want to.  It keeps you looking at it!  I love the gradient sky.', '2006-09-20 21:26:59.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2852333, 396218, 51553, '<td valign="top">I like it.</td>', 'I like it.', '2006-09-20 21:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852341, 397921, 51553, '<td valign="top">interesting composition</td>', 'interesting composition', '2006-09-20 21:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852350, 398158, 53957, '<td valign="top">It bowls me over.</td>', 'It bowls me over.', '2006-09-20 21:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852403, 396842, 33105, '<td valign="top">Great shot...can just imagine the storm about to hit!  Love the use of the plants to start the image out....8!</td>', 'Great shot...can just imagine the storm about to hit!  Love the use of the plants to start the image out....8!', '2006-09-20 21:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852406, 398487, 33105, '<td valign="top">Kinda scares me....great idea though.</td>', 'Kinda scares me....great idea though.', '2006-09-20 21:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852411, 396762, 33105, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I''m sure will do well...great DOF.</td>', 'Great shot, I''m sure will do well...great DOF.', '2006-09-20 21:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852435, 398148, 33105, '<td valign="top">Great shot...looks great B&amp;W....would like to see hoe different it is in color.    Quite exceptional. 8!</td>', 'Great shot...looks great B&W....would like to see hoe different it is in color.    Quite exceptional. 8!', '2006-09-20 21:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852462, 396986, 61387, '<td valign="top">A line that actually lead to something... :)</td>', 'A line that actually lead to something... :)', '2006-09-20 22:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852472, 397936, 33105, '<td valign="top">Great pic...the blown out whites in the lower left lost it for me though....great angle on the shot</td>', 'Great pic...the blown out whites in the lower left lost it for me though....great angle on the shot', '2006-09-20 22:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852476, 395877, 33105, '<td valign="top">Great color on the stairs....good character in the rail...really like this one...8</td>', 'Great color on the stairs....good character in the rail...really like this one...8', '2006-09-20 22:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852482, 398173, 33105, '<td valign="top">That''s bizarre</td>', 'That''s bizarre', '2006-09-20 22:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852551, 396133, 33105, '<td valign="top">Could have been a sweet shot with that shirt...the sheets "leave" something to be desired...with all black or white...probably an 8....as is 5</td>', 'Could have been a sweet shot with that shirt...the sheets "leave" something to be desired...with all black or white...probably an 8....as is 5', '2006-09-20 22:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852625, 397806, 50034, '<td valign="top">Great lines, but where''s the subject?  :(</td>', 'Great lines, but where''s the subject?  :(', '2006-09-20 23:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852633, 397847, 17837, '<td valign="top">I see the lines, but I dont feel that this was photographed in a way that I would call them "leading." A recomposition would help the photo immensly.</td>', 'I see the lines, but I dont feel that this was photographed in a way that I would call them "leading." A recomposition would help the photo immensly.', '2006-09-20 23:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852634, 398183, 50034, '<td valign="top">Pretty, but where''s the focus?  "Leading lines" are by definition "coming from two directions to converge on one subject."</td>', 'Pretty, but where''s the focus?  "Leading lines" are by definition "coming from two directions to converge on one subject."', '2006-09-20 23:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852636, 398454, 17837, '<td valign="top">You certainly have some fine leading lines here, but what are they leading me to? <br/> <br/>Things to change that would help improve the photo (imo):<br/> <br/>The horizon line is both smack dab in the middle, and also on a slant downwards from left to right. I would crop almost 3/4 of the sky out, as it really doesnt add anything to the photo.<br/> <br/>Zoom in, so that the farm or building in the back is larger. There is no real difinitive subject here.</td>', 'You certainly have some fine leading lines here, but what are they leading me to?  Things to change that would help improve the photo (imo): The horizon line is both smack dab in the middle, and also on a slant downwards from left to right. I would crop almost 3/4 of the sky out, as it really doesnt add anything to the photo. Zoom in, so that the farm or building in the back is larger. There is no real difinitive subject here.', '2006-09-20 23:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852640, 397467, 17837, '<td valign="top">I like this as it is, yet again Id like to see just the sand also.</td>', 'I like this as it is, yet again Id like to see just the sand also.', '2006-09-20 23:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852642, 398446, 17837, '<td valign="top">a fun portrait. I like the use of the glass.</td>', 'a fun portrait. I like the use of the glass.', '2006-09-20 23:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852645, 397717, 17837, '<td valign="top">Yes, these are lines. But they are not leading lines.</td>', 'Yes, these are lines. But they are not leading lines.', '2006-09-20 23:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852649, 396870, 17837, '<td valign="top">An interesting choice of subject matter. feet scare me. Good use of leading lines, the exposure seems to be about 1/2 stop underexposed? Other than that, a pretty successful image.</td>', 'An interesting choice of subject matter. feet scare me. Good use of leading lines, the exposure seems to be about 1/2 stop underexposed? Other than that, a pretty successful image.', '2006-09-20 23:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852652, 397632, 17837, '<td valign="top">A fantastic image. Your lighting is well done, the exposure is almost dead on. And, who am I kidding, I love me some hershey kiss.</td>', 'A fantastic image. Your lighting is well done, the exposure is almost dead on. And, who am I kidding, I love me some hershey kiss.', '2006-09-20 23:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852656, 396553, 17837, '<td valign="top">A very fun portrait, if I were to redo this shot, I would take that bracelet off. I am finding myself being drawn to that.</td>', 'A very fun portrait, if I were to redo this shot, I would take that bracelet off. I am finding myself being drawn to that.', '2006-09-20 23:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852660, 397633, 17837, '<td valign="top">I think you have something, just missed it with this shot. Everything seems so flat and smushed together.</td>', 'I think you have something, just missed it with this shot. Everything seems so flat and smushed together.', '2006-09-20 23:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852665, 397931, 17837, '<td valign="top">a fun abstract like photograph. I like how the stairs leads your eyes to the shadow.</td>', 'a fun abstract like photograph. I like how the stairs leads your eyes to the shadow.', '2006-09-20 23:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852668, 396440, 17837, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic bridge photograph. If the bridge is the leading line, what is it leading me to? There is no real defined subject here, so I can only give this a 5. Great shot though.</td>', 'This is a fantastic bridge photograph. If the bridge is the leading line, what is it leading me to? There is no real defined subject here, so I can only give this a 5. Great shot though.', '2006-09-20 23:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852681, 398347, 259, '<td valign="top">really nice range of tones. i like that the blacks are black and the whites are white.</td>', 'really nice range of tones. i like that the blacks are black and the whites are white.', '2006-09-20 23:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852683, 398243, 259, '<td valign="top">not bad, but could be better if the stationary objects weren''t blurred as well.</td>', 'not bad, but could be better if the stationary objects weren''t blurred as well.', '2006-09-20 23:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852685, 398253, 259, '<td valign="top">the green seems a little too neon-like.</td>', 'the green seems a little too neon-like.', '2006-09-20 23:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852688, 396307, 259, '<td valign="top">really nice composition. i really like the choice of overhead leading lines.</td>', 'really nice composition. i really like the choice of overhead leading lines.', '2006-09-20 23:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2852689, 397585, 259, '<td valign="top">i really like the green color.</td>', 'i really like the green color.', '2006-09-20 23:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
