(2854134, 398596, 62006, '<td valign="top">I like this but I am not sure it will do well based on the thread post. There are no difinative leading lines to me.</td>', 'I like this but I am not sure it will do well based on the thread post. There are no difinative leading lines to me.', '2006-09-21 14:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
