(2854141, 398062, 61505, '<td valign="top">I love this image. Had to comment if even just to say that! Very sharp and I love that it isn''t oversaturated. I believe that helps with the darkness of the background. Takes me back to year one of university... good times.</td>', 'I love this image. Had to comment if even just to say that! Very sharp and I love that it isn''t oversaturated. I believe that helps with the darkness of the background. Takes me back to year one of university... good times.', '2006-09-21 14:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
