(2854219, 396708, 64928, '<td valign="top">interesting photo</td>', 'interesting photo', '2006-09-21 15:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854226, 398420, 64928, '<td valign="top">Beautiful flowers, but I don''t see the leading lines.</td>', 'Beautiful flowers, but I don''t see the leading lines.', '2006-09-21 15:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854228, 398608, 42100, '<td valign="top">This absolutely has to be Cutter(apologies if I''m wrong).  The anchor in the corner is masterful.  It really isolates that cable and makes it a strong leading line.  Composition is excellent as well.  Definitely one of my top two picks this challenge.  Excellent!</td>', 'This absolutely has to be Cutter(apologies if I''m wrong).  The anchor in the corner is masterful.  It really isolates that cable and makes it a strong leading line.  Composition is excellent as well.  Definitely one of my top two picks this challenge.  Excellent!', '2006-09-21 15:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854229, 396236, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very bold tonal differences between the striping and pavement, a very strong attention grabber.  The trees in the mist compliment wonderfully.  Definitely one of the most pulling leading lines of the batch.  Hopefully this is not being hammered by those that think there has to be a subject at the other end of a leading line.  Beautiful!</td>', 'Very bold tonal differences between the striping and pavement, a very strong attention grabber.  The trees in the mist compliment wonderfully.  Definitely one of the most pulling leading lines of the batch.  Hopefully this is not being hammered by those that think there has to be a subject at the other end of a leading line.  Beautiful!', '2006-09-21 15:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854236, 398154, 42100, '<td valign="top">The conversion on this is excellent and really give this photo an antique feel.  Great leading lines(and lots of them) and very dynamic composition.  Well done!</td>', 'The conversion on this is excellent and really give this photo an antique feel.  Great leading lines(and lots of them) and very dynamic composition.  Well done!', '2006-09-21 15:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854238, 398031, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very dynamic photo with lots of great leading lines.  The splash of yellow in this sea of greyness is great.  Well done!</td>', 'Very dynamic photo with lots of great leading lines.  The splash of yellow in this sea of greyness is great.  Well done!', '2006-09-21 15:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854247, 397668, 42100, '<td valign="top">The curve of the rails lead you gently into the tunnel, removing any possible apprehension of entering that very dark and foreboding tunnel.  Great job!</td>', 'The curve of the rails lead you gently into the tunnel, removing any possible apprehension of entering that very dark and foreboding tunnel.  Great job!', '2006-09-21 15:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854251, 396485, 42100, '<td valign="top">Quite the rainbow of color in that sky.  Very nice angle on the pier.  Well done!</td>', 'Quite the rainbow of color in that sky.  Very nice angle on the pier.  Well done!', '2006-09-21 15:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854257, 396553, 64928, '<td valign="top">Precious! I would like to score this higher, but don''t see the leading lines.</td>', 'Precious! I would like to score this higher, but don''t see the leading lines.', '2006-09-21 15:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854261, 395760, 50695, '<td valign="top">beautiful processing</td>', 'beautiful processing', '2006-09-21 15:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854289, 397151, 50695, '<td valign="top">this looks like a wonderful photo. I do hope you upload a larger version to your portfolio so I can look at it. I''m still giving you a 7, but it probably deserves higher.</td>', 'this looks like a wonderful photo. I do hope you upload a larger version to your portfolio so I can look at it. I''m still giving you a 7, but it probably deserves higher.', '2006-09-21 15:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854294, 396817, 50695, '<td valign="top">this doesn''t look physically possible. a truly amazing, disorienting shot and a great abstract composition.</td>', 'this doesn''t look physically possible. a truly amazing, disorienting shot and a great abstract composition.', '2006-09-21 15:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854295, 396797, 50695, '<td valign="top">great composition. I might find this easier to look at if something were in focus, but at the same time I kind of like that I can just make out the child''s form, it makes her seem more universal. 7</td>', 'great composition. I might find this easier to look at if something were in focus, but at the same time I kind of like that I can just make out the child''s form, it makes her seem more universal. 7', '2006-09-21 15:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854304, 397586, 50695, '<td valign="top">this looks like one of the very first photographs. lovely.</td>', 'this looks like one of the very first photographs. lovely.', '2006-09-21 15:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854305, 398446, 50695, '<td valign="top">I L*O*V*E her reflection. good composition, too. meets the challenge well.</td>', 'I L*O*V*E her reflection. good composition, too. meets the challenge well.', '2006-09-21 15:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854306, 398161, 50695, '<td valign="top">I''ve been a little hard on photos that are just lines... but these lines lead to all sorts of interesting places, plus you have the juxtaposition of curving lines with straight lines. The monotone gives the whole picture a sense of ethereality, like it might shimmer and vanish at the slightest breath. Lovely.</td>', 'I''ve been a little hard on photos that are just lines... but these lines lead to all sorts of interesting places, plus you have the juxtaposition of curving lines with straight lines. The monotone gives the whole picture a sense of ethereality, like it might shimmer and vanish at the slightest breath. Lovely.', '2006-09-21 15:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854307, 396843, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like when lines are created indirectly from other shapes. There are in fact, no lines here. The "lines" are created only by my perception... reminding us that all photography, all reality, exists only in perception.</td>', 'I like when lines are created indirectly from other shapes. There are in fact, no lines here. The "lines" are created only by my perception... reminding us that all photography, all reality, exists only in perception.', '2006-09-21 15:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854308, 398465, 50695, '<td valign="top">there''s a starkness to this, a sharpness?, that makes this stand out among the tunnel shots. I feel drawn into a portal to another world, a disturbing world.</td>', 'there''s a starkness to this, a sharpness?, that makes this stand out among the tunnel shots. I feel drawn into a portal to another world, a disturbing world.', '2006-09-21 15:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854310, 398555, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like the subtlety of the "lines" here, they are more imagined than real. One sees lines curving among the trees as well as the lines of the path. And the viewer truly is "led," though goodness knows where.</td>', 'I like the subtlety of the "lines" here, they are more imagined than real. One sees lines curving among the trees as well as the lines of the path. And the viewer truly is "led," though goodness knows where.', '2006-09-21 15:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854311, 397920, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like the abstract qualities of this: the sickly color of the sky, the line of fog, centering the horizon line, the lack of a focal point. The lines *are* the subject. They start at the right in a bundle and then expand leftward and downward, giving a sense of motion to this emptiness.</td>', 'I like the abstract qualities of this: the sickly color of the sky, the line of fog, centering the horizon line, the lack of a focal point. The lines *are* the subject. They start at the right in a bundle and then expand leftward and downward, giving a sense of motion to this emptiness.', '2006-09-21 15:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854312, 397399, 50695, '<td valign="top">tilting the shot definitely makes for an interesting composition, but it makes it difficult for me to empathize with her balancing act. Maybe if her arms were out a little more, if she were captured in a moment of daring instead of a moment of catching herself, it would all come together better. Regardless, composition counts for a LOT and you have a good photo here.</td>', 'tilting the shot definitely makes for an interesting composition, but it makes it difficult for me to empathize with her balancing act. Maybe if her arms were out a little more, if she were captured in a moment of daring instead of a moment of catching herself, it would all come together better. Regardless, composition counts for a LOT and you have a good photo here.', '2006-09-21 15:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854314, 398597, 42100, '<td valign="top">Stellar lighting in this photo, the fading away of it in the bottom of the frame is a nice.  The whole idea of a leading line in what is pretty much an abstract is very cool as well.  Well done!</td>', 'Stellar lighting in this photo, the fading away of it in the bottom of the frame is a nice.  The whole idea of a leading line in what is pretty much an abstract is very cool as well.  Well done!', '2006-09-21 15:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854318, 398265, 50695, '<td valign="top">there''s something a little sad about the infinity column not quite reaching outside of the frame. A moody, poignant photo.</td>', 'there''s something a little sad about the infinity column not quite reaching outside of the frame. A moody, poignant photo.', '2006-09-21 15:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854319, 398253, 50695, '<td valign="top">Good dynamic composition with lines leading me all over the photo. The oversaturation is visually interesting but I don''t feel a coherent overall effect from it. Maybe it''s because of a distracting element in the background. Yes, I think the dark background seems more "real" whereas the foreground has a fantasy feel. Still a visually pleasing shot, though, and a creative interpretation of the challenge. 7</td>', 'Good dynamic composition with lines leading me all over the photo. The oversaturation is visually interesting but I don''t feel a coherent overall effect from it. Maybe it''s because of a distracting element in the background. Yes, I think the dark background seems more "real" whereas the foreground has a fantasy feel. Still a visually pleasing shot, though, and a creative interpretation of the challenge. 7', '2006-09-21 15:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854321, 398429, 50695, '<td valign="top">good lines! this is lovely to look at.</td>', 'good lines! this is lovely to look at.', '2006-09-21 15:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854322, 398259, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love the path. The person is actually obliterating one its nice curves. I''d like her to be more "integrated" into the line of the pathway. Either that or have her stand out more. You can go either way. The path itself, though, and the textures, are terrific. 7</td>', 'I love the path. The person is actually obliterating one its nice curves. I''d like her to be more "integrated" into the line of the pathway. Either that or have her stand out more. You can go either way. The path itself, though, and the textures, are terrific. 7', '2006-09-21 15:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854323, 398611, 50695, '<td valign="top">sexiest shot of the challenge.</td>', 'sexiest shot of the challenge.', '2006-09-21 15:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854327, 397323, 50695, '<td valign="top">only a vague connection to the challenge, but a truly gorgeous photograph. 7</td>', 'only a vague connection to the challenge, but a truly gorgeous photograph. 7', '2006-09-21 15:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854328, 398550, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like that the river is so reflective it''s hard to discern it from the trees.</td>', 'I like that the river is so reflective it''s hard to discern it from the trees.', '2006-09-21 15:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854329, 395831, 50695, '<td valign="top">dynamic confrontational photo with aggressively high contrast. Yeah, I''ll have some tea!</td>', 'dynamic confrontational photo with aggressively high contrast. Yeah, I''ll have some tea!', '2006-09-21 15:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854330, 398244, 50695, '<td valign="top">anarchy in the DPC!!! 7</td>', 'anarchy in the DPC!!! 7', '2006-09-21 15:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854331, 396480, 27072, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective, this is exactly what the challenge was supposed to be : a leading line pointing to the subject. Would have prefer less sky tho, to put more emphasis on the subject. I sense the sky do not add value to the picture. Having the camera closer to the road could have been fun too.</td>', 'Simple and effective, this is exactly what the challenge was supposed to be : a leading line pointing to the subject. Would have prefer less sky tho, to put more emphasis on the subject. I sense the sky do not add value to the picture. Having the camera closer to the road could have been fun too.', '2006-09-21 15:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854332, 398475, 50695, '<td valign="top">great angle</td>', 'great angle', '2006-09-21 15:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854334, 398314, 50695, '<td valign="top">love the colorful highlights and the centered composition.</td>', 'love the colorful highlights and the centered composition.', '2006-09-21 15:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854347, 398148, 27072, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, very soft. Nice tones. Crop could have been tighter, losing maybe 10-15% of the right side, eliminating the white thing at horizon level, and shifting the end of the ramp more at 2/3 of the frame. Two dust speckles on top, left of the middle. Horizon is tilt a little bit. You have in hands what can be a perfect image, in need of little adjustments.</td>', 'Beautiful image, very soft. Nice tones. Crop could have been tighter, losing maybe 10-15% of the right side, eliminating the white thing at horizon level, and shifting the end of the ramp more at 2/3 of the frame. Two dust speckles on top, left of the middle. Horizon is tilt a little bit. You have in hands what can be a perfect image, in need of little adjustments.', '2006-09-21 15:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854358, 396871, 27072, '<td valign="top">The essence of a dynamic composition. Leading line well understood. The image can improve a lot by getting rid of the negative spaces : sky add nothing, grass on the right side add nothing. Crop that and you''ll get a powerful end point located at top 2/3 of the frame, + the horizon line at top third. Keep going, good start.</td>', 'The essence of a dynamic composition. Leading line well understood. The image can improve a lot by getting rid of the negative spaces : sky add nothing, grass on the right side add nothing. Crop that and you''ll get a powerful end point located at top 2/3 of the frame, + the horizon line at top third. Keep going, good start.', '2006-09-21 15:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854362, 397936, 27072, '<td valign="top">Nice catch, curves are great. Maybe missing some contrast.</td>', 'Nice catch, curves are great. Maybe missing some contrast.', '2006-09-21 15:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854368, 397666, 27072, '<td valign="top">Good idea! I would have prefer seeing more of the railroad in front. Couple shuld have been at the end of the railroad. A bit dark.</td>', 'Good idea! I would have prefer seeing more of the railroad in front. Couple shuld have been at the end of the railroad. A bit dark.', '2006-09-21 15:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854378, 398018, 27072, '<td valign="top">Nice, really nive. Well capture, good work on the exposure and B/W rendition. Why so much space on the left? The white house in the background disturbs me... Out of that, a great shot.</td>', 'Nice, really nive. Well capture, good work on the exposure and B/W rendition. Why so much space on the left? The white house in the background disturbs me... Out of that, a great shot.', '2006-09-21 16:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854391, 398528, 27072, '<td valign="top">This is fun, love the duality : curves on one side, straights on the other. Nice catch. Losing 5% of the bottom give more impact to the image.</td>', 'This is fun, love the duality : curves on one side, straights on the other. Nice catch. Losing 5% of the bottom give more impact to the image.', '2006-09-21 16:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854396, 398247, 27072, '<td valign="top">Scores great with me....</td>', 'Scores great with me....', '2006-09-21 16:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854405, 396726, 27072, '<td valign="top">Nice try, but too many things in there: where are my eyes supposed to go? To the boat? To the girl with her dog? To the trees on the sides? Eliminating some elements by cropping thighter would give more impact and emphasis to the subject.</td>', 'Nice try, but too many things in there: where are my eyes supposed to go? To the boat? To the girl with her dog? To the trees on the sides? Eliminating some elements by cropping thighter would give more impact and emphasis to the subject.', '2006-09-21 16:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854412, 396170, 27072, '<td valign="top">The red color and the subject made the shoot. Nice catch.</td>', 'The red color and the subject made the shoot. Nice catch.', '2006-09-21 16:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854415, 397586, 62099, '<td valign="top">Need a little bit more contrast.</td>', 'Need a little bit more contrast.', '2006-09-21 16:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854420, 397666, 62099, '<td valign="top">Image needs to be a little lighter</td>', 'Image needs to be a little lighter', '2006-09-21 16:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854431, 396307, 27072, '<td valign="top">Suits the challenge perfecly. Maybe too much space at the top, cropping 25% of it would have help a lot.</td>', 'Suits the challenge perfecly. Maybe too much space at the top, cropping 25% of it would have help a lot.', '2006-09-21 16:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
