(2854487, 398347, 27072, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful image. Technically, scores high. In relation to the challenge, medium to high. Even if the tones in the sky are beautiful, for me it is removing the eyes from the interest point (the intersection of the fences, with the sheeps). Big black shadow in the foreground is also distracting. Seeing more sheeps would have been good I''ll guess. Nice work on the B/W rendition.</td>', 'Very beautiful image. Technically, scores high. In relation to the challenge, medium to high. Even if the tones in the sky are beautiful, for me it is removing the eyes from the interest point (the intersection of the fences, with the sheeps). Big black shadow in the foreground is also distracting. Seeing more sheeps would have been good I''ll guess. Nice work on the B/W rendition.', '2006-09-21 16:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854491, 396553, 27072, '<td valign="top">Great but no cake! Perfect shoot and subject, but the leading line is not what comes first in mind watching the picture.</td>', 'Great but no cake! Perfect shoot and subject, but the leading line is not what comes first in mind watching the picture.', '2006-09-21 16:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854506, 398532, 27072, '<td valign="top">Really nice place and good composition. A lot of potential for a great image, but there''s something missing for me, cant point out exactly what DOF or contrast, or if the tone isnt warm enough. Good eye spotting this shot tho. And again, I''m loving it, its just something in PP can bring it really outstanding.</td>', 'Really nice place and good composition. A lot of potential for a great image, but there''s something missing for me, cant point out exactly what DOF or contrast, or if the tone isnt warm enough. Good eye spotting this shot tho. And again, I''m loving it, its just something in PP can bring it really outstanding.', '2006-09-21 16:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854510, 398454, 27072, '<td valign="top">Nice graphics features in there : having only three colors to play with = good. Textures : soil, grass, sky = good. Angle and straight lines = good. Only the horizon in the middle kills it for me. Different cropping would add a lot, losing at least half the sky. Keep going.</td>', 'Nice graphics features in there : having only three colors to play with = good. Textures : soil, grass, sky = good. Angle and straight lines = good. Only the horizon in the middle kills it for me. Different cropping would add a lot, losing at least half the sky. Keep going.', '2006-09-21 16:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2854516, 396485, 27072, '<td valign="top">Real real nice. This will do good I''m sure. One of my top for now. Nothing more else to say, everythings fine in this shot and fits exactly the challenge. I''ll say there will be a lot of discussion on the benefits (or not) of the presence of the bird in the right. Well done!</td>', 'Real real nice. This will do good I''m sure. One of my top for now. Nothing more else to say, everythings fine in this shot and fits exactly the challenge. I''ll say there will be a lot of discussion on the benefits (or not) of the presence of the bird in the right. Well done!', '2006-09-21 16:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
