(2854757, 397916, 64086, '<td valign="top">Nice lines. Sky is a bit bright and perhaps a tighter crop to eliminate the foreground or greater DOF to bring the high grass in the foreground into better focus.</td>', 'Nice lines. Sky is a bit bright and perhaps a tighter crop to eliminate the foreground or greater DOF to bring the high grass in the foreground into better focus.', '2006-09-21 18:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
