(2854958, 398491, 61818, '<td valign="top">Needs greater dof so the thing the lines are leading to is in focus.</td>', 'Needs greater dof so the thing the lines are leading to is in focus.', '2006-09-21 20:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855030, 398062, 36382, '<td valign="top">Love this!</td>', 'Love this!', '2006-09-21 21:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855034, 397100, 36382, '<td valign="top">Lots of nice detail in the building.  Not so much in the sky but still worth 9</td>', 'Lots of nice detail in the building.  Not so much in the sky but still worth 9', '2006-09-21 21:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855049, 398446, 36382, '<td valign="top">Nice post processing.  The reflection looks great</td>', 'Nice post processing.  The reflection looks great', '2006-09-21 21:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855082, 396986, 6678, '<td valign="top">Perfection</td>', 'Perfection', '2006-09-21 21:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855181, 398475, 33352, '<td valign="top">This is one of five photos I gave 7, meaning come back and study,7 is my nagative No. and these I really study, My first thought is using sepia has created the aging effect to go with the era, the lines altogh not in your face have a lot of strenght,and the overall composition is amazing.all the angles seem to come together well, TOP SHELF...10</td>', 'This is one of five photos I gave 7, meaning come back and study,7 is my nagative No. and these I really study, My first thought is using sepia has created the aging effect to go with the era, the lines altogh not in your face have a lot of strenght,and the overall composition is amazing.all the angles seem to come together well, TOP SHELF...10', '2006-09-21 21:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855187, 398555, 33352, '<td valign="top">This is one of my top 5, for this challenge,and have come back to study this image, the depth of field is good, the use of B&amp;W tone suites to creat an era, and the shadow &amp; highlights work well.....9</td>', 'This is one of my top 5, for this challenge,and have come back to study this image, the depth of field is good, the use of B&W tone suites to creat an era, and the shadow & highlights work well.....9', '2006-09-21 21:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855193, 396681, 33352, '<td valign="top">Have come back for a second look,and see you have jagged edges on the planks &amp; right hand rails, this occurrs after sharpening sometimes,and is best removed by zooming 1 step, but deserves an... 8</td>', 'Have come back for a second look,and see you have jagged edges on the planks & right hand rails, this occurrs after sharpening sometimes,and is best removed by zooming 1 step, but deserves an... 8', '2006-09-21 22:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855212, 398372, 44441, '<td valign="top">very nice!</td>', 'very nice!', '2006-09-21 22:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855236, 397700, 44441, '<td valign="top">if you could get the line to match up and flip it so the water is ontop, that would look trippy!</td>', 'if you could get the line to match up and flip it so the water is ontop, that would look trippy!', '2006-09-21 22:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855283, 398576, 33947, '<td valign="top">Love the curve of the rails and the feeling of being led over the bridge. Also, I like that the dark background keeps the focus on the bridge and the little house as the important points of interest. Nice lighting and contrast.</td>', 'Love the curve of the rails and the feeling of being led over the bridge. Also, I like that the dark background keeps the focus on the bridge and the little house as the important points of interest. Nice lighting and contrast.', '2006-09-21 22:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855305, 397885, 33947, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot. Love the expression, lighting and the position of the little girl. One of my top favorites. 10</td>', 'Very cool shot. Love the expression, lighting and the position of the little girl. One of my top favorites. 10', '2006-09-21 22:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855310, 397272, 33947, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous light and really effective perspective. Neat composition. Love it!10</td>', 'Gorgeous light and really effective perspective. Neat composition. Love it!10', '2006-09-21 22:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855312, 396472, 33947, '<td valign="top">Fantastic color and contrast. Meets theme well. 10</td>', 'Fantastic color and contrast. Meets theme well. 10', '2006-09-21 22:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855317, 398148, 33947, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, ethereal shot. Love the mood, and love how the piers take you into it. 10</td>', 'Beautiful, ethereal shot. Love the mood, and love how the piers take you into it. 10', '2006-09-21 22:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855330, 397843, 3102, '<td valign="top">Very nice, dramatic shot!  I love the lighting here.  A 10 in my book.</td>', 'Very nice, dramatic shot!  I love the lighting here.  A 10 in my book.', '2006-09-21 23:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855333, 398148, 3102, '<td valign="top">Just plain excellent in every respect.  I''m not usually a fan of sepia, or sepia-like stuff, but this is just enough tinting without being overpowering, and it works well with the subject matter. 10</td>', 'Just plain excellent in every respect.  I''m not usually a fan of sepia, or sepia-like stuff, but this is just enough tinting without being overpowering, and it works well with the subject matter. 10', '2006-09-21 23:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855335, 398616, 3102, '<td valign="top">Certainly a great shot... reminds me very much of this one:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=96222" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/244/thumb/96222.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/244/thumb/96222.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/244/thumb/96222.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Certainly a great shot... reminds me very much of this one: ', '2006-09-21 23:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855336, 396762, 3102, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done!  Great colors and sharpness.</td>', 'Very nicely done!  Great colors and sharpness.', '2006-09-21 23:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855339, 396485, 3102, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot!  I did a similar one on the east coast earlier this month.  It might have been an interesting experiment to do a longer exposure to catch the flow of the water.</td>', 'Very nice shot!  I did a similar one on the east coast earlier this month.  It might have been an interesting experiment to do a longer exposure to catch the flow of the water.', '2006-09-21 23:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855341, 396778, 3102, '<td valign="top">Excellent representation of the challenge!  Super colors, too.  I gave it a 9, only because it could be just a hint sharper.</td>', 'Excellent representation of the challenge!  Super colors, too.  I gave it a 9, only because it could be just a hint sharper.', '2006-09-21 23:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855342, 398549, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m always envious of folks who live in Arizona and Utah :)  I love the colors... nice selection of subject.</td>', 'I''m always envious of folks who live in Arizona and Utah :)  I love the colors... nice selection of subject.', '2006-09-21 23:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855343, 396444, 3102, '<td valign="top">An excellent shot for this challenge!  I like the randomness of the lines.  Congrats!</td>', 'An excellent shot for this challenge!  I like the randomness of the lines.  Congrats!', '2006-09-21 23:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855345, 396811, 3102, '<td valign="top">Great job keeping everything in focus.  Many folks would have blurred the tracks in the foreground, which would have detracted from this.  Great representation of the challenge, too!</td>', 'Great job keeping everything in focus.  Many folks would have blurred the tracks in the foreground, which would have detracted from this.  Great representation of the challenge, too!', '2006-09-21 23:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855349, 396817, 3102, '<td valign="top">I love this kind of photography, and you''ve done a super job of it here!  I like the way the water converges, and the way you used the long exposure to capture it this way.</td>', 'I love this kind of photography, and you''ve done a super job of it here!  I like the way the water converges, and the way you used the long exposure to capture it this way.', '2006-09-21 23:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855351, 395877, 3102, '<td valign="top">An excellent find!  I like the unique and somewhat whimsical color choices in the steps.  I like the diagonals in the composition, too.</td>', 'An excellent find!  I like the unique and somewhat whimsical color choices in the steps.  I like the diagonals in the composition, too.', '2006-09-21 23:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855354, 398223, 3102, '<td valign="top">Great perspective!  Makes me somewhat woozy just looking at it!  :)</td>', 'Great perspective!  Makes me somewhat woozy just looking at it!  :)', '2006-09-21 23:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855357, 398568, 3102, '<td valign="top">Very simple, and works very well for the challenge.  This would probably go over well on a stock photography site.</td>', 'Very simple, and works very well for the challenge.  This would probably go over well on a stock photography site.', '2006-09-21 23:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855359, 398324, 3102, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge, I must say!  I wish this had been in just a little better focus with less compression (there seems to be a good bit of jpg artifacting going on here).  Still among my favorites, though.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge, I must say!  I wish this had been in just a little better focus with less compression (there seems to be a good bit of jpg artifacting going on here).  Still among my favorites, though.', '2006-09-21 23:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855364, 397151, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid this doesn''t work for me in any respect.  It''s way too small to judge, blurry, and compressed into a 12k file size.  It may have been an interesting shot if we could see it better.</td>', 'I''m afraid this doesn''t work for me in any respect.  It''s way too small to judge, blurry, and compressed into a 12k file size.  It may have been an interesting shot if we could see it better.', '2006-09-21 23:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855366, 396828, 3102, '<td valign="top">Not sure what''s going on here exactly, but to say the least, I''m not fond of the processing here.</td>', 'Not sure what''s going on here exactly, but to say the least, I''m not fond of the processing here.', '2006-09-21 23:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855368, 398368, 3102, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t really work well for me in terms of fitting the challenge, and even if it did, it seems a bit wishy-washy in quality.  The colors seem to have a pinkish glow to them, particularly on the bottom sign.</td>', 'This doesn''t really work well for me in terms of fitting the challenge, and even if it did, it seems a bit wishy-washy in quality.  The colors seem to have a pinkish glow to them, particularly on the bottom sign.', '2006-09-21 23:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855371, 396797, 3102, '<td valign="top">Seems to me that *something* should be in good focus here, preferably the girl since that''s what I''m drawn to.  As it is, I don''t really know what I''m supposed to be looking at.  It may have made for an excellent shot had you physically moved over to the right (getting rid of the white blob of stuff at the end of the bridge) with the lines leading to the girl.</td>', 'Seems to me that *something* should be in good focus here, preferably the girl since that''s what I''m drawn to.  As it is, I don''t really know what I''m supposed to be looking at.  It may have made for an excellent shot had you physically moved over to the right (getting rid of the white blob of stuff at the end of the bridge) with the lines leading to the girl.', '2006-09-21 23:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855374, 397851, 3102, '<td valign="top">A bit too small and a bit too contrasty, I''m afraid.  Looks like it was oversharpened a bit, too.</td>', 'A bit too small and a bit too contrasty, I''m afraid.  Looks like it was oversharpened a bit, too.', '2006-09-21 23:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855375, 396793, 3102, '<td valign="top">Waaaaaaaay to blurry.  I''m afraid this one just doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'Waaaaaaaay to blurry.  I''m afraid this one just doesn''t work for me.', '2006-09-21 23:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855424, 398277, 65319, '<td valign="top">Nice photo to illustrate your leading lines and your witty title!  7.</td>', 'Nice photo to illustrate your leading lines and your witty title!  7.', '2006-09-21 23:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855430, 396666, 65319, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color and balanced composition.  Very pretty photo.</td>', 'Beautiful color and balanced composition.  Very pretty photo.', '2006-09-21 23:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855435, 398425, 65319, '<td valign="top">Brilliant use of light.  8.</td>', 'Brilliant use of light.  8.', '2006-09-21 23:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855439, 398513, 65319, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition.  7.</td>', 'Beautiful composition.  7.', '2006-09-21 23:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855449, 398063, 65319, '<td valign="top">I love the color of this monkey!  Beautiful clarity and detail in the face of the monkey.  7.</td>', 'I love the color of this monkey!  Beautiful clarity and detail in the face of the monkey.  7.', '2006-09-21 23:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855453, 398163, 48228, '<td valign="top">"WOW"..... What a capture, and for being in the right place at the right time. I really love how you have captured this one, with two pelicans and also the turtles on the log..... The colors are differant and maybe a little odd, but in context, I still really like the image.</td>', '"WOW"..... What a capture, and for being in the right place at the right time. I really love how you have captured this one, with two pelicans and also the turtles on the log..... The colors are differant and maybe a little odd, but in context, I still really like the image.', '2006-09-21 23:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855459, 397683, 48228, '<td valign="top">Excellent angle here, as it is very strong with leading lines.....</td>', 'Excellent angle here, as it is very strong with leading lines.....', '2006-09-21 23:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855486, 396986, 40126, '<td valign="top">nicely done</td>', 'nicely done', '2006-09-21 23:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855497, 397919, 40126, '<td valign="top">nicely done.</td>', 'nicely done.', '2006-09-21 23:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855601, 398409, 50034, '<td valign="top">If you have a manual to go along with this photo called, <u>Learning The Ropes With Women</u>, please send me a copy.  The other day I was parusing the forums when the title "Oxymoron Challenge" caught my eye.  Apparently, the old saw,<u>Intelligent Man</u>, still tickles the fancy of genteel feminity.  IMHO that this is a near-universal perception for the opposable gender, I am willing to allow.  However, as I am sure at least some of my "compatriots" will agree (at least in their hearts,) "Understandable Woman" is a bit closer to the truth of the oxymoron!   ;)</td>', 'If you have a manual to go along with this photo called, Learning The Ropes With Women, please send me a copy.  The other day I was parusing the forums when the title "Oxymoron Challenge" caught my eye.  Apparently, the old saw,Intelligent Man, still tickles the fancy of genteel feminity.  IMHO that this is a near-universal perception for the opposable gender, I am willing to allow.  However, as I am sure at least some of my "compatriots" will agree (at least in their hearts,) "Understandable Woman" is a bit closer to the truth of the oxymoron!   ;)', '2006-09-22 00:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
