(2855886, 398475, 48228, '<td valign="top">This would have to be one of the "BEST" images, I have seen for ages.....<br/>This has to be a winning image, and a ribbon for sure. <br/>I just love the textures, and the sepiatones make this image timeless.....<br/>I looked at this again, as I love it so much, and must add it as a favorite as well.....</td>', 'This would have to be one of the "BEST" images, I have seen for ages.....This has to be a winning image, and a ribbon for sure. I just love the textures, and the sepiatones make this image timeless.....I looked at this again, as I love it so much, and must add it as a favorite as well.....', '2006-09-22 02:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855887, 397719, 48228, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking.....Bumping this up, as I just love it.....</td>', 'Breathtaking.....Bumping this up, as I just love it.....', '2006-09-22 02:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
