(2856586, 397951, 27524, '<td valign="top">Seems you used lot of zoom and that might cause trouble with focus. You can use USM but that will halp you only if you have atleast soft focus. Your object is taken from back that also doesnt make picture interesting. Keep shoting!</td>', 'Seems you used lot of zoom and that might cause trouble with focus. You can use USM but that will halp you only if you have atleast soft focus. Your object is taken from back that also doesnt make picture interesting. Keep shoting!', '2006-09-22 12:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2856596, 397151, 27524, '<td valign="top">I find the place of shoting very interesting...model is also nice. I dont know just why you made it so small and blured...was that intentional? Or the model minded...looks like bit nude. I guess the intention of photograpy is to show it.</td>', 'I find the place of shoting very interesting...model is also nice. I dont know just why you made it so small and blured...was that intentional? Or the model minded...looks like bit nude. I guess the intention of photograpy is to show it.', '2006-09-22 12:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2856609, 398623, 27524, '<td valign="top">It has the major things that photography need object, focus and meet the challenge. Just there is no spirit, no creativity... would like to see photographer to look further then his lens. Nothing personal just my opinion. Keep shoting!</td>', 'It has the major things that photography need object, focus and meet the challenge. Just there is no spirit, no creativity... would like to see photographer to look further then his lens. Nothing personal just my opinion. Keep shoting!', '2006-09-22 12:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2856632, 396793, 27524, '<td valign="top">This is one tricky photo...I must say I almoust voted on it like blured which depending on subject is 1-2. Only at last moment I noticed your idea and had to return to change my vote. Sill I think you could have improved your composition. I would keep just half of gutter and maybe more space on right side, to emphasize your object. Or to capture snail in front but from lower level and seeing gutter behind the snail. I wish you good luck, the challenge is to see the snail. Maybe should have gave hint in title.</td>', 'This is one tricky photo...I must say I almoust voted on it like blured which depending on subject is 1-2. Only at last moment I noticed your idea and had to return to change my vote. Sill I think you could have improved your composition. I would keep just half of gutter and maybe more space on right side, to emphasize your object. Or to capture snail in front but from lower level and seeing gutter behind the snail. I wish you good luck, the challenge is to see the snail. Maybe should have gave hint in title.', '2006-09-22 12:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2856636, 396754, 60581, '<td valign="top">it needs little bit of hue/saturation. It is bit flat</td>', 'it needs little bit of hue/saturation. It is bit flat', '2006-09-22 12:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2856659, 397338, 65319, '<td valign="top">I gave this photo an 9 with an extra point just for your wonderful sense of humor!!!</td>', 'I gave this photo an 9 with an extra point just for your wonderful sense of humor!!!', '2006-09-22 12:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2856672, 395877, 65319, '<td valign="top">The colors in this photos are so lovely!!!  9.</td>', 'The colors in this photos are so lovely!!!  9.', '2006-09-22 12:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2856677, 398276, 65319, '<td valign="top">This photo is stunning.  10.</td>', 'This photo is stunning.  10.', '2006-09-22 12:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2856681, 398334, 65319, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful shot!!!  10.</td>', 'What a beautiful shot!!!  10.', '2006-09-22 12:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2856728, 397739, 34134, '<td valign="top">Good shot.. draws me in... right toward the cat!</td>', 'Good shot.. draws me in... right toward the cat!', '2006-09-22 12:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2856843, 398347, 50695, '<td valign="top">this shot is partitioned into sections that compete for attention. that little fragment in the lower left is a rich surprise when the eye finally gets there, and is foiled perfectly by the impossibly dark shadow of lower right. It looks like a fenced off section of darkness. In fact, this photo reminds me of nothing so much as a Judgement Day painting, with the "sheep" being separated from the "goats." The distant background is that Heaven we will never attain. This is one of my personal ribbon winners and a fave.</td>', 'this shot is partitioned into sections that compete for attention. that little fragment in the lower left is a rich surprise when the eye finally gets there, and is foiled perfectly by the impossibly dark shadow of lower right. It looks like a fenced off section of darkness. In fact, this photo reminds me of nothing so much as a Judgement Day painting, with the "sheep" being separated from the "goats." The distant background is that Heaven we will never attain. This is one of my personal ribbon winners and a fave.', '2006-09-22 13:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2856844, 397739, 50695, '<td valign="top">beautiful textures throughout this photo. I love that there are lines on the cat as well. Stellar fulfillment of the challenge. 10</td>', 'beautiful textures throughout this photo. I love that there are lines on the cat as well. Stellar fulfillment of the challenge. 10', '2006-09-22 13:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2856845, 397896, 50695, '<td valign="top">one of my favorites for this challenge. Minimalist and yet noisy at the same time. The lines are subtle yet rough. The face for all its tininess is expressive and commanding. 10</td>', 'one of my favorites for this challenge. Minimalist and yet noisy at the same time. The lines are subtle yet rough. The face for all its tininess is expressive and commanding. 10', '2006-09-22 13:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2856846, 396854, 50695, '<td valign="top">I can''t even tell what that is, but its reflective and shimmery and invasive. Where are you taking me? I love this shot. 10</td>', 'I can''t even tell what that is, but its reflective and shimmery and invasive. Where are you taking me? I love this shot. 10', '2006-09-22 13:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2856850, 397885, 50695, '<td valign="top">Wow. I hope I get to see this on the homepage. the exposed midriff is a little distracting but it doesn''t bother her so why should it bother me? Not just a glorious composition, but a perfect execution of the challenge. 10</td>', 'Wow. I hope I get to see this on the homepage. the exposed midriff is a little distracting but it doesn''t bother her so why should it bother me? Not just a glorious composition, but a perfect execution of the challenge. 10', '2006-09-22 13:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2856856, 396895, 50695, '<td valign="top">this is just fascinating. somehow everything on the bottom of the picture is iconic. The Business Man, the Port-o-San, the Bridge, the Yacht, the Power Line. Those horizontal lines somehow make everything abstract and in motion. This is an artist''s photograph more than a photographer''s photograph. 10</td>', 'this is just fascinating. somehow everything on the bottom of the picture is iconic. The Business Man, the Port-o-San, the Bridge, the Yacht, the Power Line. Those horizontal lines somehow make everything abstract and in motion. This is an artist''s photograph more than a photographer''s photograph. 10', '2006-09-22 13:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2856860, 397683, 50695, '<td valign="top">perfect fulfillment of challenge. this is like the moment of creation, when nothingness is on the edge of becoming something... characters, a story. It all begins with the separation of light from darkness. We see Kaos staining the left side of the picture, and we see darkness pierced by divine shafts of white. smells like jjbeguin to me... 10</td>', 'perfect fulfillment of challenge. this is like the moment of creation, when nothingness is on the edge of becoming something... characters, a story. It all begins with the separation of light from darkness. We see Kaos staining the left side of the picture, and we see darkness pierced by divine shafts of white. smells like jjbeguin to me... 10', '2006-09-22 13:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2856861, 396726, 50695, '<td valign="top">how did you get that sailboat to float over her head like that? How did you bring the dreams of a young girl to life? How did you bring heaven down to earth? Why, with leading lines, of course! 10</td>', 'how did you get that sailboat to float over her head like that? How did you bring the dreams of a young girl to life? How did you bring heaven down to earth? Why, with leading lines, of course! 10', '2006-09-22 13:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2856862, 398559, 50695, '<td valign="top">great personality, which is too often missing from dpc portraits. and a great composition that fulfills the challenge. and great detail and texture. this is a real winner of a photo. 9</td>', 'great personality, which is too often missing from dpc portraits. and a great composition that fulfills the challenge. and great detail and texture. this is a real winner of a photo. 9', '2006-09-22 14:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2856875, 396870, 50695, '<td valign="top">the sand makes the feet seem ethereal. a truly remarkable effect.</td>', 'the sand makes the feet seem ethereal. a truly remarkable effect.', '2006-09-22 14:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2856881, 395557, 50695, '<td valign="top">I''m voting you higher because of the soft focus and/or graininess of this. It has a soft mood, somewhere between sad and beautiful.</td>', 'I''m voting you higher because of the soft focus and/or graininess of this. It has a soft mood, somewhere between sad and beautiful.', '2006-09-22 14:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2856885, 398063, 50695, '<td valign="top">this is the purest example of leading lines in the challenge.</td>', 'this is the purest example of leading lines in the challenge.', '2006-09-22 14:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2856888, 398121, 50695, '<td valign="top">As the owner of some curvas peligrosas myself, you''ve got yourself quite a collection! I enjoy your choice to rotate the canvas, nice abstract.</td>', 'As the owner of some curvas peligrosas myself, you''ve got yourself quite a collection! I enjoy your choice to rotate the canvas, nice abstract.', '2006-09-22 14:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2856891, 398031, 50695, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for subway shots and this is no exception. I love the sense of emptiness. Also a very good fulfillment of the challenge.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for subway shots and this is no exception. I love the sense of emptiness. Also a very good fulfillment of the challenge.', '2006-09-22 14:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2857068, 397806, 50674, '<td valign="top">I came back to comment on a few photos, and looking at yours again made me want to boost it a bit, and that I shall do<br/>I like your idea, but wish there was something there to focus on other than  just these lines.</td>', 'I came back to comment on a few photos, and looking at yours again made me want to boost it a bit, and that I shall doI like your idea, but wish there was something there to focus on other than  just these lines.', '2006-09-22 16:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
