(2857081, 397717, 50674, '<td valign="top">the focus seems a bit off - fantastic colours there on the left - maybe another crop would have worked better<br/>I really like the idea and behind there are all the lines that tell us the age,  hidden</td>', 'the focus seems a bit off - fantastic colours there on the left - maybe another crop would have worked betterI really like the idea and behind there are all the lines that tell us the age,  hidden', '2006-09-22 16:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
