(2857110, 396847, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice image, but I don''t get where the lines take the viewer - where do they "lead"?  No worries, I''m not voting this challenge, just observing/commenting.  ;^)</td>', 'This is a very nice image, but I don''t get where the lines take the viewer - where do they "lead"?  No worries, I''m not voting this challenge, just observing/commenting.  ;^)', '2006-09-22 16:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
