(2857121, 398089, 30049, '<td valign="top">Not sure what it is, nor does it matter...you''ve done a nice job of using lines to "Lead" the viewer into this image and having some focal point at the destination.  I''m just observing/commenting this challenge.  Good luck!  ;^)</td>', 'Not sure what it is, nor does it matter...you''ve done a nice job of using lines to "Lead" the viewer into this image and having some focal point at the destination.  I''m just observing/commenting this challenge.  Good luck!  ;^)', '2006-09-22 16:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
