(2858155, 397911, 57384, '<td valign="top">You may like it this way, but I don''t think there''s enough focus here. Just a matter of my personal taste I think.</td>', 'You may like it this way, but I don''t think there''s enough focus here. Just a matter of my personal taste I think.', '2006-09-23 02:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2858163, 397323, 57384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, beautiful picture. I''d probably give it a 9, but I think leading lines is the challenge. Sorry.</td>', 'Beautiful, beautiful picture. I''d probably give it a 9, but I think leading lines is the challenge. Sorry.', '2006-09-23 02:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2858179, 398067, 57384, '<td valign="top">Good idea and original, I wish the crop was tighter at the top to get rid of all the black. It strikes me as odd when I look at it, because it isn''t the same top to bottom.</td>', 'Good idea and original, I wish the crop was tighter at the top to get rid of all the black. It strikes me as odd when I look at it, because it isn''t the same top to bottom.', '2006-09-23 02:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2858202, 395484, 57384, '<td valign="top">You''re going to get a whole bunch of "This picture should be larger" comments and yes the picture should be bigger, but I see enough to see that I like it. It''s very interesting and it does what good pictures do, tell a story.</td>', 'You''re going to get a whole bunch of "This picture should be larger" comments and yes the picture should be bigger, but I see enough to see that I like it. It''s very interesting and it does what good pictures do, tell a story.', '2006-09-23 02:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2858216, 398247, 57384, '<td valign="top">I''m giving you an extra point for having the title "silly shoes". Awesome!</td>', 'I''m giving you an extra point for having the title "silly shoes". Awesome!', '2006-09-23 02:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2858372, 397951, 56400, '<td valign="top">Bad case of the jaggies on here. Looks like the shot was blown up too much.</td>', 'Bad case of the jaggies on here. Looks like the shot was blown up too much.', '2006-09-23 06:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2858522, 395603, 27524, '<td valign="top">Its nice image...interesting composition but quality bit takes it down. Its taken probably in evening and lack of light made it pretty grainy.</td>', 'Its nice image...interesting composition but quality bit takes it down. Its taken probably in evening and lack of light made it pretty grainy.', '2006-09-23 09:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2858524, 396376, 27524, '<td valign="top">I must say its very abstract. I like the curves and texture of whatever object it is but that piece of rope feels completely out of the place.</td>', 'I must say its very abstract. I like the curves and texture of whatever object it is but that piece of rope feels completely out of the place.', '2006-09-23 09:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2858526, 398513, 27524, '<td valign="top">Nice evening photo... interesting colors but it looks somehow bit flat. I think it swould be more interesting if you would took it from level of rails.</td>', 'Nice evening photo... interesting colors but it looks somehow bit flat. I think it swould be more interesting if you would took it from level of rails.', '2006-09-23 09:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2858528, 398161, 27524, '<td valign="top">Very simple photo...maybe should have taken it in evening when low sun gives it more texture. Just noticed that the straight schraches must be from skates or skies. I would probably go for natural lines and concentrate on spot where they give moust interesting curves.</td>', 'Very simple photo...maybe should have taken it in evening when low sun gives it more texture. Just noticed that the straight schraches must be from skates or skies. I would probably go for natural lines and concentrate on spot where they give moust interesting curves.', '2006-09-23 09:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2858530, 398374, 27524, '<td valign="top">Interesting dark tunnel...There is defenetly too much floor in photo. Maybe would take picture from side of one of the walls to make it more dinamic.</td>', 'Interesting dark tunnel...There is defenetly too much floor in photo. Maybe would take picture from side of one of the walls to make it more dinamic.', '2006-09-23 09:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2858572, 397586, 64928, '<td valign="top">I like your choice of tone and the way the lines int he petal lead to the light.</td>', 'I like your choice of tone and the way the lines int he petal lead to the light.', '2006-09-23 10:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
