(2861079, 398475, 41337, '<td valign="top">Would have preferred a different angle to this but the image quality and editing is first rate.</td>', 'Would have preferred a different angle to this but the image quality and editing is first rate.', '2006-09-24 18:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2861083, 398062, 55838, '<td valign="top">Back to comment.  I love this shot...a little different kind of leading lines and the perspective you chose along w/ the womans expression makes this a very interesting shot to look at.  My only nit is that I think the crop is just the tiniest bit tight at the top and bottom.  Maybe a quarter inch more - maybe even less - each way would have been good (assuming it was clean grass &amp; blackness).  Nice job.  Bumping to 8.</td>', 'Back to comment.  I love this shot...a little different kind of leading lines and the perspective you chose along w/ the womans expression makes this a very interesting shot to look at.  My only nit is that I think the crop is just the tiniest bit tight at the top and bottom.  Maybe a quarter inch more - maybe even less - each way would have been good (assuming it was clean grass & blackness).  Nice job.  Bumping to 8.', '2006-09-24 18:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2861084, 398421, 55838, '<td valign="top">Excellent leading lines and very interesting composition (even the holy pants!).  B&amp;W was clearly the way to go here.  Very nicely done.  Bumping to 8.</td>', 'Excellent leading lines and very interesting composition (even the holy pants!).  B&W was clearly the way to go here.  Very nicely done.  Bumping to 8.', '2006-09-24 18:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
