(2861088, 398575, 55838, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous and very "Sherpetesque" I would say.  If this is Sherpet...beautiful as usual.  If this is not Sherpet...way to go!<br/>*************<br/>Back to bump to 8.  Lovely!</td>', 'Gorgeous and very "Sherpetesque" I would say.  If this is Sherpet...beautiful as usual.  If this is not Sherpet...way to go!*************Back to bump to 8.  Lovely!', '2006-09-24 18:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
