(2863039, 397739, 64035, '<td valign="top">Great cat shot...so hard to get them to do this, I find. They''re always more interested in sitting on the camera, or your face, or begging for food.</td>', 'Great cat shot...so hard to get them to do this, I find. They''re always more interested in sitting on the camera, or your face, or begging for food.', '2006-09-25 11:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2863044, 396910, 64035, '<td valign="top">I agree that the fence is interesting, and the lighthouse looks good, but the foreground and the middle is so scrubby and dull and just messy.</td>', 'I agree that the fence is interesting, and the lighthouse looks good, but the foreground and the middle is so scrubby and dull and just messy.', '2006-09-25 11:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2863045, 398351, 50695, '<td valign="top">a busy yet tightly organized composition. I could easily see this as a magazine cover for some kind of Modernist, secretly pro-Soviet publication of the 20s. 9</td>', 'a busy yet tightly organized composition. I could easily see this as a magazine cover for some kind of Modernist, secretly pro-Soviet publication of the 20s. 9', '2006-09-25 11:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2863047, 398308, 64035, '<td valign="top">Nice pavement, and the lower part is great (and fits the challenge), but above that it gets confused and messy.</td>', 'Nice pavement, and the lower part is great (and fits the challenge), but above that it gets confused and messy.', '2006-09-25 11:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2863050, 397843, 64035, '<td valign="top">Lovely blue light, and the contrast to the yellows in the wings is great. It feels a bit like the leading lines don''t lead to anything interesting - for some reason the back of the cathedral isn''t a stop point, and that makes this image a little confusing. I''m not sure that the very low camera angle has helped you.</td>', 'Lovely blue light, and the contrast to the yellows in the wings is great. It feels a bit like the leading lines don''t lead to anything interesting - for some reason the back of the cathedral isn''t a stop point, and that makes this image a little confusing. I''m not sure that the very low camera angle has helped you.', '2006-09-25 11:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2863052, 398154, 50695, '<td valign="top">like the old-timey processing, but what really cinches this for me are the lines that close in the bottom center of the photo. It makes such a strong statement, suggests that the lines themselves are the subject of this photo. It creates a strong central shape that focuses attention, which turns the ball on the lower right from a distraction into an interesting detail. 9</td>', 'like the old-timey processing, but what really cinches this for me are the lines that close in the bottom center of the photo. It makes such a strong statement, suggests that the lines themselves are the subject of this photo. It creates a strong central shape that focuses attention, which turns the ball on the lower right from a distraction into an interesting detail. 9', '2006-09-25 11:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2863053, 398528, 64035, '<td valign="top">Great lines on this. Very interesting. There''s perhaps too much detail on the right hand side of the photo - it pulls the eye a little bit. A more featureless shot would be better.</td>', 'Great lines on this. Very interesting. There''s perhaps too much detail on the right hand side of the photo - it pulls the eye a little bit. A more featureless shot would be better.', '2006-09-25 11:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2863056, 398355, 50695, '<td valign="top">the yellow hue makes this more interesting. It looks like a tapestry of a photo of an allegory. 8</td>', 'the yellow hue makes this more interesting. It looks like a tapestry of a photo of an allegory. 8', '2006-09-25 11:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2863057, 398095, 64035, '<td valign="top">This is almost great, but there''s something missing. I think this would be better with an athlete...</td>', 'This is almost great, but there''s something missing. I think this would be better with an athlete...', '2006-09-25 11:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2863058, 398607, 50695, '<td valign="top">the ornate beauty of decay, perfectly captured.</td>', 'the ornate beauty of decay, perfectly captured.', '2006-09-25 12:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2863061, 398031, 64035, '<td valign="top">I love the d-sat to leave the yellow - especially with the reflection in the roof. I''m not convinced the figure is helping this image much.</td>', 'I love the d-sat to leave the yellow - especially with the reflection in the roof. I''m not convinced the figure is helping this image much.', '2006-09-25 12:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2863067, 395542, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like how the actor is almost completely silhouetted. The only thing we see is the back wall. This emphasizes the artificiality of theater, but also, because it is a backdrop of letters, it suggests the entire creative process of theater, which starts as a piece of writing, which is then brought to life by actors and a director. Here we have the actor in darkness, so we feel we are watching the very moment of creation, a sunrise of creativity. 9</td>', 'I like how the actor is almost completely silhouetted. The only thing we see is the back wall. This emphasizes the artificiality of theater, but also, because it is a backdrop of letters, it suggests the entire creative process of theater, which starts as a piece of writing, which is then brought to life by actors and a director. Here we have the actor in darkness, so we feel we are watching the very moment of creation, a sunrise of creativity. 9', '2006-09-25 12:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2863076, 398532, 50695, '<td valign="top">the processing is so 70s, as are the pinball tables and floor. This photo is rich with nostalgia. It is my childhood. I wasn''t a huge pinball machine player, but my Dad actually bought a pinball machine and we had one in the house. It''s also an excellent fulfillment of the challenge, a small subject in the corner is made prominent purely through the use of leading lines. I would suggest "Old School Gamer" as the title. 9</td>', 'the processing is so 70s, as are the pinball tables and floor. This photo is rich with nostalgia. It is my childhood. I wasn''t a huge pinball machine player, but my Dad actually bought a pinball machine and we had one in the house. It''s also an excellent fulfillment of the challenge, a small subject in the corner is made prominent purely through the use of leading lines. I would suggest "Old School Gamer" as the title. 9', '2006-09-25 12:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2863079, 398608, 50695, '<td valign="top">excellent processing, perfect for this photo and this challenge. I love how the lines virtually disappear into their highlights. 9</td>', 'excellent processing, perfect for this photo and this challenge. I love how the lines virtually disappear into their highlights. 9', '2006-09-25 12:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2863081, 397700, 50695, '<td valign="top">this shot is almost dizzying because it "flips" visually, similarly to those cubes in the optical illusion, are they concave or convex? Looking again, I suppose the image is inverted? If so, it''s an excellent use of this technique (which is so rarely used well). I love being disoriented. I think it''s the job of the visual artist to disorient... and sometimes to reorient. 9</td>', 'this shot is almost dizzying because it "flips" visually, similarly to those cubes in the optical illusion, are they concave or convex? Looking again, I suppose the image is inverted? If so, it''s an excellent use of this technique (which is so rarely used well). I love being disoriented. I think it''s the job of the visual artist to disorient... and sometimes to reorient. 9', '2006-09-25 12:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2863082, 397223, 50695, '<td valign="top">looks like an old, fading Japanese print held up to a fire. Such texture, I''m convinced I can touch my screen and feel the bumps. 8</td>', 'looks like an old, fading Japanese print held up to a fire. Such texture, I''m convinced I can touch my screen and feel the bumps. 8', '2006-09-25 12:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
