(2863101, 396842, 50695, '<td valign="top">Great portrait. Leading lines are used to make the subject seem imperiled and isolated. She herself, though, seems defiant and tough. This conflict creates a complexity of character in your portrait. 9</td>', 'Great portrait. Leading lines are used to make the subject seem imperiled and isolated. She herself, though, seems defiant and tough. This conflict creates a complexity of character in your portrait. 9', '2006-09-25 12:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
