(2863105, 397708, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like the competing subjects. One is right on the vanishing point: all lines lead to him... and yet he is facing away from us and completely silhouetted. The other faces us, has much more visual interest, but is in a less strategic position, *unless* we think of the lines as leading OUT, rather than in. If that''s the case, she is swept up in this geometric outpouring, as are we. I love a picture that forces me to think and rethink, all the while affecting me viscerally. 8</td>', 'I like the competing subjects. One is right on the vanishing point: all lines lead to him... and yet he is facing away from us and completely silhouetted. The other faces us, has much more visual interest, but is in a less strategic position, *unless* we think of the lines as leading OUT, rather than in. If that''s the case, she is swept up in this geometric outpouring, as are we. I love a picture that forces me to think and rethink, all the while affecting me viscerally. 8', '2006-09-25 12:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2863107, 395723, 50695, '<td valign="top">How did you make that heart? I love the effect. And I love your blown highlights and sensuous shadows. 8</td>', 'How did you make that heart? I love the effect. And I love your blown highlights and sensuous shadows. 8', '2006-09-25 12:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
