(2867565, 396483, 39702, '<td valign="top">Tough shot, it took me a second to figure out what was going on.  The line from the kite is almost invisible but I don''t really know that there''s a whole lot that you could do about it given the distance (and that''s not really the focus of the shot anyhoo).  I like the sloping ground up to the person flying the kite; nice interesting angle.  Wish I could have seen more of the kite; a little dark.  But overall, good color and I like it. Gave it a 6.</td>', 'Tough shot, it took me a second to figure out what was going on.  The line from the kite is almost invisible but I don''t really know that there''s a whole lot that you could do about it given the distance (and that''s not really the focus of the shot anyhoo).  I like the sloping ground up to the person flying the kite; nice interesting angle.  Wish I could have seen more of the kite; a little dark.  But overall, good color and I like it. Gave it a 6.', '2006-09-27 00:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
