(2867666, 395882, 37252, '<td valign="top">I didnt vote this one - so I dont know who gave you the low scores. I like the image, but for the challenge it doesnt have a strong theme. The idea of leading lines would be that there are lines, arches, etc that lead my eye to the subject - in this case the lighthouse. The lines here lead my eye away from the lighthouse. I can only speculate that the low scores may have something to do with that.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-09-27 00:23:48.</i></td>', 'I didnt vote this one - so I dont know who gave you the low scores. I like the image, but for the challenge it doesnt have a strong theme. The idea of leading lines would be that there are lines, arches, etc that lead my eye to the subject - in this case the lighthouse. The lines here lead my eye away from the lighthouse. I can only speculate that the low scores may have something to do with that.', '2006-09-27 01:14:59.000000', '2006-09-27 01:23:48.000000', 0),
(2867667, 397272, 33352, '<td valign="top">Great finish front page,&amp; persoal best.</td>', 'Great finish front page,& persoal best.', '2006-09-27 01:15:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(2867668, 395882, 93, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote on this.. but a 4 would have probably been my vote. Why?  I don''t see any lines leading to anything.  All your lines lead *away* from everything, and mostly to the middle left of the photo.<br/> <br/>It''s not a bad photo in and of itself. Documentary type, good vacation photo, but the connection to the challenge is missing almost completely, and it lacks anything that would give DPC voters a reason to vote it anything high.<br/> <br/>As for the 3 and below votes.. well, all I can say is that I was a pretty forgiving voter when I was voting, so I understand why they would have been given.. but your main votes were 4 - 6.. so focus on that.</td>', 'I didn''t vote on this.. but a 4 would have probably been my vote. Why?  I don''t see any lines leading to anything.  All your lines lead *away* from everything, and mostly to the middle left of the photo. It''s not a bad photo in and of itself. Documentary type, good vacation photo, but the connection to the challenge is missing almost completely, and it lacks anything that would give DPC voters a reason to vote it anything high. As for the 3 and below votes.. well, all I can say is that I was a pretty forgiving voter when I was voting, so I understand why they would have been given.. but your main votes were 4 - 6.. so focus on that.', '2006-09-27 01:15:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(2867671, 398148, 40126, '<td valign="top">Big lead from the pack. Congratulations!</td>', 'Big lead from the pack. Congratulations!', '2006-09-27 01:15:51.000000', NULL, 0),
