(2867678, 398616, 40126, '<td valign="top">speactacular view. well captured.</td>', 'speactacular view. well captured.', '2006-09-27 01:17:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(2867690, 398616, 57, '<td valign="top">Wow, I am so excited by this placing!  (and so close to a ribbon, too!)  Thanks everyone for the great comments (and scores).<br/> <br/>Have to say really quickly that I was dismayed to find out that my photo appears to be almost an exact copy of a previous winner from 2004.  My challenge entry history will show that I was inactive on DPC at that time, so I had no idea that photo existed.  All I can say is that I would never intentionally copy anyone''s work - I simply picked the best vacation photo for this challenge topic.  This photo was taken from a popular stop on the Denali park highway - I''m certainly not the first person to get a shot from this vantage, nor will I be the last, lol.  :^)<br/> <br/>Thanks again, this is incredibly exciting for me.</td>', 'Wow, I am so excited by this placing!  (and so close to a ribbon, too!)  Thanks everyone for the great comments (and scores). Have to say really quickly that I was dismayed to find out that my photo appears to be almost an exact copy of a previous winner from 2004.  My challenge entry history will show that I was inactive on DPC at that time, so I had no idea that photo existed.  All I can say is that I would never intentionally copy anyone''s work - I simply picked the best vacation photo for this challenge topic.  This photo was taken from a popular stop on the Denali park highway - I''m certainly not the first person to get a shot from this vantage, nor will I be the last, lol.  :^) Thanks again, this is incredibly exciting for me.', '2006-09-27 01:19:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(2867692, 398569, 40126, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by photoheathen:</b></div><hr/><i> this deserved so much better.  congrats on the top-25, but I really should be congratulating you on a ribbon. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>thank you! thank you! thank you!</td>', 'Originally posted by photoheathen: this deserved so much better.  congrats on the top-25, but I really should be congratulating you on a ribbon.   thank you! thank you! thank you!', '2006-09-27 01:20:44.000000', NULL, 0),
