(2867966, 397683, 48560, '<td valign="top">Refreshing take on the challenge. You know what strikes me when I first looked at this photo? It is how it resembles the works of JJBeguin - it''s a compliment and I hope you''re not offended. Anyway, back to the photo: I like the way the strong lines separated, or framed the person in it. I would prefer the person who got covered isn''t so, but then I assumed this is not a staged shot so it was unavoidable. Overall, I liked the feeling of this shot - it has a "gangsta" sort of appearance to it. <br/> <br/>crayon</td>', 'Refreshing take on the challenge. You know what strikes me when I first looked at this photo? It is how it resembles the works of JJBeguin - it''s a compliment and I hope you''re not offended. Anyway, back to the photo: I like the way the strong lines separated, or framed the person in it. I would prefer the person who got covered isn''t so, but then I assumed this is not a staged shot so it was unavoidable. Overall, I liked the feeling of this shot - it has a "gangsta" sort of appearance to it.  crayon', '2006-09-27 02:08:50.000000', NULL, 0),
