(2867978, 398217, 48560, '<td valign="top">Hi Robert, your photo is saying to me, "sun is rising, and the peace and stillness will be broken soon". If that is what you were trying to capture, then you''ve done a hell of a good job there. I like the colours on the grass. One little thing that distracted me is the cylindrical thing on the bottom-left corner of your composition.</td>', 'Hi Robert, your photo is saying to me, "sun is rising, and the peace and stillness will be broken soon". If that is what you were trying to capture, then you''ve done a hell of a good job there. I like the colours on the grass. One little thing that distracted me is the cylindrical thing on the bottom-left corner of your composition.', '2006-09-27 02:11:42.000000', NULL, 0),
