(2868022, 395882, 45475, '<td valign="top">If it''s any consolation, I thought it a wonderful scene and felt drawn in immediately. So for me, you succeeded in meeting the challenge requirement, no problem there. I also like the natural colour and light, it''s exactly as one would expect to see, and again, it''s simply a wonderfully charming scene. I gave it a 9 :)</td>', 'If it''s any consolation, I thought it a wonderful scene and felt drawn in immediately. So for me, you succeeded in meeting the challenge requirement, no problem there. I also like the natural colour and light, it''s exactly as one would expect to see, and again, it''s simply a wonderfully charming scene. I gave it a 9 :)', '2006-09-27 02:25:44.000000', NULL, 0),
