(2876505, 396640, 60862, '<td valign="top">Hey, just found this.  Congrats on the personal best!  Just look at all those 7-10 scores. :)<br/> <br/>I agree with the other folks who''ve suggested cropping it right at the junction point.  Other than that, the clouds are a bit bright.<br/> <br/>But it''s a very nice image, and you should be proud of it!</td>', 'Hey, just found this.  Congrats on the personal best!  Just look at all those 7-10 scores. :) I agree with the other folks who''ve suggested cropping it right at the junction point.  Other than that, the clouds are a bit bright. But it''s a very nice image, and you should be proud of it!', '2006-09-29 19:15:05.000000', NULL, 0),
