(2892390, 398031, 30982, '<td valign="top">Woman, this rocks!  I didn''t vote in this challenge and to tell you the truth, forgot to look through the results.  AWESOME score and great finish!  But that''s neither here nor there.  I absolutely love the picture.  I love the desat and the yellow.  And I really love that it''s a "shot from the hip" kinda thing.  My kinda picture, and you did it really, really, really well!  Really well!</td>', 'Woman, this rocks!  I didn''t vote in this challenge and to tell you the truth, forgot to look through the results.  AWESOME score and great finish!  But that''s neither here nor there.  I absolutely love the picture.  I love the desat and the yellow.  And I really love that it''s a "shot from the hip" kinda thing.  My kinda picture, and you did it really, really, really well!  Really well!', '2006-10-03 19:33:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(2892417, 396170, 30982, '<td valign="top">Rowan this time!  Not sure about the desat, but reading your explanation, I can understand why you did it.  I don''t mind "busy" when it serves a purpose, and it doesn''t bother me here at all.  In fact it serves as kind of a neat contrast - all the busy hard lines and and metal and plastic edges comtrasted with a lovely little girl and her concentration.</td>', 'Rowan this time!  Not sure about the desat, but reading your explanation, I can understand why you did it.  I don''t mind "busy" when it serves a purpose, and it doesn''t bother me here at all.  In fact it serves as kind of a neat contrast - all the busy hard lines and and metal and plastic edges comtrasted with a lovely little girl and her concentration.', '2006-10-03 19:49:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(2892436, 397806, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great job on your first challenge, Aidan!</td>', 'Great job on your first challenge, Aidan!', '2006-10-03 19:56:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(2894537, 397668, 60195, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by xXxscarletxXx:</b></div><hr/><i> Beautiful but too much neat image? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Funny you should say that.   Actually, none.  I did run a pass on it, but it made the rails look unnatural, so didn''t go with it.  :o)</td>', 'Originally posted by xXxscarletxXx: Beautiful but too much neat image?   Funny you should say that.   Actually, none.  I did run a pass on it, but it made the rails look unnatural, so didn''t go with it.  :o)', '2006-10-04 06:10:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(2894990, 398018, 30982, '<td valign="top">Dang, this is good.  You totally nailed the challenge as far as that stuff goes, with the lines everywhere leading to your subject.  But aside from that, this is simply a wonderful portrait.  Love the tones - can''t imagine it in anything other than B&amp;W.  Perfect light.  This really does not suck.</td>', 'Dang, this is good.  You totally nailed the challenge as far as that stuff goes, with the lines everywhere leading to your subject.  But aside from that, this is simply a wonderful portrait.  Love the tones - can''t imagine it in anything other than B&W.  Perfect light.  This really does not suck.', '2006-10-04 09:24:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(2897463, 397885, 66139, '<td valign="top">I really do appreciate this photo. I like the black &amp; white but not that dark, the tone &amp; color make everything just right.  Good job.</td>', 'I really do appreciate this photo. I like the black & white but not that dark, the tone & color make everything just right.  Good job.', '2006-10-04 21:19:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(2897472, 396811, 66139, '<td valign="top">I''m glad you cropped the sky out, the train tracks is what makes this whole photo.  I think the angle you took of the tracks actually draws you into the picture and leads you down and around the bend.  It''s captivating.</td>', 'I''m glad you cropped the sky out, the train tracks is what makes this whole photo.  I think the angle you took of the tracks actually draws you into the picture and leads you down and around the bend.  It''s captivating.', '2006-10-04 21:21:14.000000', NULL, 0),
