(2903538, 398031, 24212, '<td valign="top">Shot from the hip at a third of a second!? Well done. The whole picture leads to the lady walking along the platform. There are so many textures to look at here. It''s wonderful. Great shot.</td>', 'Shot from the hip at a third of a second!? Well done. The whole picture leads to the lady walking along the platform. There are so many textures to look at here. It''s wonderful. Great shot.', '2006-10-06 15:59:50.000000', NULL, 0),
