(2906041, 398314, 48954, '<td valign="top">great idea and wonderfull posed processing</td>', 'great idea and wonderfull posed processing', '2006-10-07 16:31:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(2908291, 396483, 55838, '<td valign="top">I remember voting on this - 6.  This surely is a "leading line" but in a different sense than it is usually thought of in photography! :)  Very attractive colors and sky and I like the slant on the horizon.  The clouds could use a little brightening IMO (might have been accomplished with slective colors - not sure).  Very cool shot that I think might have received a better score in a different challenge.</td>', 'I remember voting on this - 6.  This surely is a "leading line" but in a different sense than it is usually thought of in photography! :)  Very attractive colors and sky and I like the slant on the horizon.  The clouds could use a little brightening IMO (might have been accomplished with slective colors - not sure).  Very cool shot that I think might have received a better score in a different challenge.', '2006-10-08 14:47:46.000000', NULL, 0),
