(2922440, 397402, 33672, '<td valign="top">I quickly added this to my favorites as there is a similar foot bridge near me where I walk my dog in Manchester, CT. I''ve tried to take photos of this bridge and thought of it when I saw the theme. This one is a perfect example of what I see but can''t seem to get it on my camera. Very nice tones and texture. I like the shadow play. Execellent job and severely under rated.</td>', 'I quickly added this to my favorites as there is a similar foot bridge near me where I walk my dog in Manchester, CT. I''ve tried to take photos of this bridge and thought of it when I saw the theme. This one is a perfect example of what I see but can''t seem to get it on my camera. Very nice tones and texture. I like the shadow play. Execellent job and severely under rated.', '2006-10-12 13:44:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(2922456, 396242, 41794, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective of this shot - not just a normal head-on bridge shot. The curve of the road leaves the viewer wondering what is around the bend.</td>', 'I like the perspective of this shot - not just a normal head-on bridge shot. The curve of the road leaves the viewer wondering what is around the bend.', '2006-10-12 13:48:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(2929222, 398018, 32997, '<td valign="top">you know I have to tell you something about when I saw this in the challenge..I looked at it, and thought now here is one hell of a shot, by someone who is more interested in capturing a beautiful moment than in the score..you could just whip right by it..but if you stop and look, then it starts on you...and you realize that you are seeing real Zen..this shot has breath...<br/>figures it was you...work on your scores...:)(do I have to put these smiley faces? I just don''t want to offend..well in print anyway...:))<br/></td>', 'you know I have to tell you something about when I saw this in the challenge..I looked at it, and thought now here is one hell of a shot, by someone who is more interested in capturing a beautiful moment than in the score..you could just whip right by it..but if you stop and look, then it starts on you...and you realize that you are seeing real Zen..this shot has breath...figures it was you...work on your scores...:)(do I have to put these smiley faces? I just don''t want to offend..well in print anyway...:))', '2006-10-14 23:42:08.000000', NULL, 0),
