(3003006, 398614, 33182, '<td valign="top">Yeah, some more fill light would have been nice. Maybe try it again with a spotlight on her face.</td>', 'Yeah, some more fill light would have been nice. Maybe try it again with a spotlight on her face.', '2006-11-05 18:05:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(3020583, 398487, 22537, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot and a fun technique to play with.  I''d suggest trying this again in a completely dark environment as it is very cool to play with this effect. Try a very long exposure with you camera mounted on a tripod. Set the timer on the shutter and then get in position for your light painting. You may also consider fiddling with the white balance as that will change the color of your light stream to something different. Look into my portfolio next week and you''ll see what I''ve done with this.</td>', 'Very cool shot and a fun technique to play with.  I''d suggest trying this again in a completely dark environment as it is very cool to play with this effect. Try a very long exposure with you camera mounted on a tripod. Set the timer on the shutter and then get in position for your light painting. You may also consider fiddling with the white balance as that will change the color of your light stream to something different. Look into my portfolio next week and you''ll see what I''ve done with this.', '2006-11-10 16:06:53.000000', NULL, 0),
