(4213613, 396870, 22301, '<td valign="top">I was just looking at all your recent photos and was amazed at how far you have come! I thought I would bump your first entry so maybe you would notice too. Although even this phot has some of your style/vision. You are an amazing photog, I am glad to say I was one of the first to fav you. :) cheers</td>', 'I was just looking at all your recent photos and was amazed at how far you have come! I thought I would bump your first entry so maybe you would notice too. Although even this phot has some of your style/vision. You are an amazing photog, I am glad to say I was one of the first to fav you. :) cheers', '2007-11-01 20:32:54.000000', NULL, 0),
