(4574871, 398075, 63267, '<td valign="top">Byt the time you are through you are going to be able to produce a whole book on nothing but this lighthouse.  That is a good thing because you have a great ability of capturing it at different times to enhance the elements.  This photo is a perfect example of that.  Brilliant capture.</td>', 'Byt the time you are through you are going to be able to produce a whole book on nothing but this lighthouse.  That is a good thing because you have a great ability of capturing it at different times to enhance the elements.  This photo is a perfect example of that.  Brilliant capture.', '2008-03-19 17:26:46.000000', NULL, 0),
